 "caption": "TABLE II. Points on the 2<sup>1</sup>A-3<sup>1</sup>A surface of conical intersection. Distances are in a<sub>0</sub>, angles are in degrees, the energy E<sub>x</sub>=E<sub>I</sub>=E<sub>J</sub> is in eV, and the energy splitting ΔE<sub>IJ</sub>≡E<sub>I</sub>−E<sub>J</sub> is in cm<sup>−1</sup>. R(NO) is fixed and all the other parameters are optimized except as noted.",
